-- Baseline marker for the adoption of Flyway (AP-480 / P-480.1).
--
-- The schema is still generated by Hibernate (spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update)
-- while AP-482 defines the constraints and indexes. This migration intentionally
-- contains no DDL: it only records version 1 in flyway_schema_history so later
-- migrations can be ordered.
--
-- Existing databases are baselined at version 1 (spring.flyway.baseline-on-migrate=true)
-- and skip this file; empty databases execute it as a no-op.
--
-- Before switching prod to ddl-auto=validate, the full schema must be captured in
-- migrations and its parity with the JPA entities verified (P-480.2 / AP-482).
